# 💻 Interview Preparation Hub

A modern and responsive Interview Preparation Hub built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**. The application helps developers prepare for technical interviews by organizing questions into categories, tracking progress, bookmarking important questions, and storing progress with Local Storage.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 📚 Browse interview questions by category
- 🔍 Search questions instantly
- ⭐ Bookmark important questions
- ✅ Mark questions as completed
- 👁️ Show / Hide answers
- 📊 Dashboard with preparation statistics
- 💾 Local Storage support
- 📱 Fully Responsive Design
- 🎨 Modern UI with smooth animations

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)
- Local Storage API

