---

## ✨ How It Works

1. Browse interview questions.
2. Search questions by keyword.
3. Filter questions by category.
4. Show or hide answers.
5. Bookmark important questions.
6. Mark completed questions.
7. Track your preparation progress through the dashboard.
8. Progress is automatically saved using Local Storage.

